<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-13T09:47:58.204Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:47:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to abduct and kill civilians, as seen in the kidnapping of a Kaduna farmer whose corpse was sent after a N56m ransom and the abduction of a 3‑year-old girl in Zamfara, while police rescued the child and arrested a suspect. Armed men attacked Peter Obi opposition rallies in Lagos, killing supporters and prompting Obi to condemn the violence and call for arrests. Protesters also assaulted opposition supporters with chairs in Lagos, leading police to open a probe into the incident. Separately, police in Imo began investigating a suspected cult killing. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQeEZocDhmNF9JMUJJZUZJTEROelQ4bFBlR0RNX3hHR3ExeHlGYnJ3Nm1HR3lCc3FoNU0tTXJUTDM0Qi1zMTMtYU5DNEF1Q0xLZWQ3YlFNNlFlQ01naUFvbnNGZE80NXZBT01tVDh3TXFSVXc2RU4tVklaanFiTWF5a214X1c2ZExmUXBpVklRX2pxODg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPX0RHTTNBUy1ScjJ4ekxwUXpTclJDRGZKSGM4cVR0Rnl6Qmozby1YM213czh1X3VEeDIwVmN0d2x3cWxCMXV4N2NORTl1Q2NBMTlzYXd5SEp2MlFNbVpSQjV6RThSUFFvTXlFTGxqMzhvYnpselNGRzRyOU5BNTMydUZxckpqUnVyOVhF?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNZUZKWXVBZTNObldWY05PRmZ0NjNqbHhwbVEyYUZGb1ZqZFhDY0wyQ3RxTzBxVEJvOUh2ZnZCWjhxOUlyVUROREdWN0RYc0cxZUhNTWFFazNXVG5VdTJha3psODdEZU90X1pzeFN4UjZDQ0VuSy01dl9lOTNVaHFuMThkX1pBOUQyT3BDTll6ODJpSmpJTXFwekl5VkNORDBocFdxY3JDZ19NMXh4d2p0VllTNXY?oc=5&quot;&gt;FRCN HQ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQaExWOE12c1hDcDE0SnpLUlNhc1pTWjNYMUk5dmJUZWdGd3BCMEZYTkJraWw0cXcyN1RPUFM3a1VDTVhkejczdlR1NWJwOVBQTXFTRXh1VjNXZXVMcC05THpoME5wcDBIYmkyWnp6TlJhdUFRUFBpbEdsdkxzc0p5UEtEdldzXzFXNlMtUUJZU2dYZ1RSNS1